    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75316" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀροφή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέφω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roof of a house,</i> or <i>ceiling of a room,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.298
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.373.246
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.148
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				121
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				173
			</span></i>, etc.: pleon., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταστέγασμα τῆς ὀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.155
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διελεῖν τὴν ὀ.</span> take off
			the <i>tiling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.48
			</span></i> ; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέραμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i>woodwork of the roof,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.3.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>top</i> of a beehive, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				624a6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Syrian name
			of a plant, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κροκοδιλιάς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				11.2
			</span></i>.</div>
